WEBVTT

00:00:06.090 --> 00:00:07.250
Rona.

00:00:07.250 --> 00:00:08.730
Yes, Father.

00:00:09.100 --> 00:00:13.490
Do not forget what you must do as 
the princess of Lapanesta Kingdom,

00:00:13.800 --> 00:00:16.240
and do not forget your dream.

00:00:16.790 --> 00:00:18.220
I will not.

00:00:18.660 --> 00:00:21.900
You can entrust it all to me.

00:00:23.170 --> 00:00:24.220
Open the gate!

00:00:26.940 --> 00:00:30.920
Princess Rona Pricipa 
O'Lapanesta is departing!

00:00:38.300 --> 00:00:40.680
Waiting for me at the end of this trip is...

00:00:41.240 --> 00:00:43.520
Rona is coming to be at your side,

00:00:44.960 --> 00:00:46.950
my Hero!

00:00:58.450 --> 00:01:01.830
Endro!

00:02:18.600 --> 00:02:19.970
And then, surprise!

00:02:19.970 --> 00:02:23.870
The evil god that had been sealed in 
the underwater temple was revived!

00:02:24.400 --> 00:02:28.000
The Hero's party headed to the underwater 
temple to protect the world!

00:02:28.290 --> 00:02:32.540
Then we waged an explosive punch-out 
battle with the evil god waiting there!

00:02:32.980 --> 00:02:36.650
And when we were in dire straits, 
the Hero's Sword began to glow

00:02:36.650 --> 00:02:39.180
and brought an end to the evil god's ambitions!

00:02:39.730 --> 00:02:42.300
And so we maintained world peace!

00:02:42.300 --> 00:02:44.180
And all lived happily ever after!

00:02:44.760 --> 00:02:48.060
I see. So at the behest of 
the mackerel you saved,

00:02:48.060 --> 00:02:53.440
you defeated the evil god that was sealed 
away and saved the world from danger.

00:02:53.620 --> 00:02:54.820
That's right!

00:02:55.120 --> 00:02:56.090
Is that so?

00:02:56.530 --> 00:02:57.850
I see...

00:02:58.950 --> 00:03:00.320
Redo it.

00:03:00.320 --> 00:03:02.200
What?!

00:03:02.450 --> 00:03:04.800
Man, Mao-chan is so mean!

00:03:04.800 --> 00:03:07.380
Why won't she believe us?

00:03:09.550 --> 00:03:11.960
For once, I agree with you.

00:03:12.320 --> 00:03:15.130
We definitely defeated an evil god.

00:03:15.130 --> 00:03:18.010
I suppose we need a witness... or witfish?

00:03:18.010 --> 00:03:20.420
I feel bad for him since he's so far away,

00:03:20.420 --> 00:03:23.010
but should we ask that 
mackerelman to come here for us?

00:03:23.350 --> 00:03:27.100
Yusha, that was a very interesting tale!

00:03:27.100 --> 00:03:28.090
Uh-huh!

00:03:28.090 --> 00:03:32.020
It was just like picture book stories
 about Heroes that I read as a child.

00:03:32.020 --> 00:03:33.360
Tell us another sometime!

00:03:34.730 --> 00:03:38.610
Our story's being treated like 
a fabricated picture book tale.

00:03:38.980 --> 00:03:39.850
Yusha...

00:03:39.850 --> 00:03:41.460
H-Huh?

00:03:41.460 --> 00:03:45.400
I don't think anyone really
recognizes you as the Hero.

00:03:48.960 --> 00:03:51.300
Yu-chan, you can avert 
your eyes all you like,

00:03:51.300 --> 00:03:53.620
but reality will chase you as far as it has to.

00:03:53.620 --> 00:03:55.750
It's like a struggle for survival in the wild.

00:03:56.080 --> 00:03:59.380
But, but... I <i>am</i> the real Hero!

00:03:59.380 --> 00:04:01.880
Oh, yeah! I even have the Hero's Sword!

00:04:08.080 --> 00:04:08.880
Huh?

00:04:08.880 --> 00:04:10.280
Hey! It's rusting!

00:04:10.280 --> 00:04:12.900
The legendary Hero's Sword is rusting!

00:04:13.090 --> 00:04:17.070
Well, it's going to get a little rusty 
if you swing it around on the beach.

00:04:18.310 --> 00:04:20.210
There are even barnacles on it.

00:04:20.940 --> 00:04:26.410
By the way, did you know this bad, 
scary legend about barnacles?

00:04:27.260 --> 00:04:31.330
One adventurer fell down a cliff
 covered with barnacles

00:04:27.840 --> 00:04:31.330
Hold on! Wait! No, wait!

00:04:31.330 --> 00:04:33.520
and hurt his knee.

00:04:31.330 --> 00:04:33.520
I said wait!

00:04:37.970 --> 00:04:39.730
Chibi-chan, do they taste good?

00:04:41.900 --> 00:04:43.860
She sure looks like she likes it.

00:04:44.790 --> 00:04:48.800
That reminds me. Barnacles are relatives 
of shrimp and crabs, aren't they?

00:04:48.800 --> 00:04:50.060
Drool...

00:04:51.120 --> 00:04:52.840
What's the matter, Mei-chan?

00:04:52.840 --> 00:04:55.100
There's a lot of noise outside.

00:04:55.660 --> 00:04:56.470
Horses!

00:04:56.470 --> 00:04:57.200
They're knights!

00:04:57.200 --> 00:04:58.450
Cool!

00:05:01.210 --> 00:05:03.950
Oh! What a magnificent carriage!

00:05:04.590 --> 00:05:06.850
Well, of course it looks magnificent.

00:05:06.850 --> 00:05:09.770
That's the crest of the Lapanesta Kingdom.

00:05:10.800 --> 00:05:12.680
Lapanesta?

00:05:12.680 --> 00:05:14.770
You care less about that 
than about barnacles?

00:05:14.770 --> 00:05:17.270
Oh, come on. We covered this in class.

00:05:17.780 --> 00:05:23.140
The Lapanesta Kingdom is the oldest kingdom,
and the only one here on Naral Island.

00:05:23.140 --> 00:05:24.970
The Hero and her party have long—

00:05:24.970 --> 00:05:26.220
Someone's coming out!

00:05:30.600 --> 00:05:32.490
Fluffy!

00:05:32.490 --> 00:05:34.160
Her hair's so fluffy!

00:05:34.160 --> 00:05:35.990
Her dress is so fluffy!

00:05:35.990 --> 00:05:38.480
She's so cute and fluffy!

00:05:40.720 --> 00:05:42.350
How do you do, everyone?

00:05:42.970 --> 00:05:48.490
I am the princess of the Lapanesta 
Kingdom, Rona Pricipa O'Lapanesta.

00:05:55.540 --> 00:05:57.220
Uh, ahem.

00:05:58.600 --> 00:06:04.050
We are humbly honored that you have 
come all this way to visit us, Princess.

00:06:04.050 --> 00:06:04.500
I am—

00:06:04.500 --> 00:06:08.020
My, you're a good girl who can give 
a proper greeting, aren't you?

00:06:08.020 --> 00:06:10.130
Let me give you some candy as a reward.

00:06:10.910 --> 00:06:11.640
Here.

00:06:12.080 --> 00:06:13.140
<i>We relate.</i>

00:06:16.100 --> 00:06:20.090
I am... deeply... grateful.

00:06:20.610 --> 00:06:22.470
M-My apologies!

00:06:22.470 --> 00:06:24.400
I didn't know you were a teacher.

00:06:24.650 --> 00:06:27.720
It's fine. I'm used to it by now.

00:06:27.720 --> 00:06:32.410
Anyway, what business brings you 
here to our adventurer school?

00:06:34.160 --> 00:06:37.160
I'm here to meet the Hero.

00:06:37.160 --> 00:06:39.780
Huh?! Th-The Hero?

00:06:39.780 --> 00:06:40.460
Yes!

00:06:40.460 --> 00:06:43.100
I heard that the Hero of 
this era had been born,

00:06:43.100 --> 00:06:46.080
so I just couldn't wait to—Oh.

00:06:46.620 --> 00:06:49.430
No, I've come as a representative 
of the Kingdom.

00:06:49.650 --> 00:06:52.940
I-I see. The Hero, huh?

00:06:52.940 --> 00:06:55.170
I suppose there is one,
 but there kind of isn't,

00:06:55.170 --> 00:06:59.440
and there is, but there isn't,
 and while there is, there isn't...

00:06:59.730 --> 00:07:05.070
I mean, if there isn't one, the question is 
where does a Hero come from or go...

00:07:08.550 --> 00:07:10.890
The Hero is right here!

00:07:12.980 --> 00:07:14.330
Wh-What?!

00:07:16.460 --> 00:07:19.250
Exploding with courage, Yulia Chardiet!

00:07:19.970 --> 00:07:23.340
The healing priest, Ellenoar Seiran!

00:07:24.130 --> 00:07:27.460
Full of food and dreams, Fai Fai!

00:07:27.880 --> 00:07:32.410
Five Cartado a day, Mather Enderstto!

00:07:32.620 --> 00:07:35.500
Together, the four of us are the Hero's party!

00:07:40.280 --> 00:07:41.980
That went better than last time!

00:07:43.140 --> 00:07:47.990
It was worth using the special effects 
Cartado I'd been holding on to.

00:07:51.530 --> 00:07:53.820
Wh-Why?!

00:07:53.820 --> 00:07:57.360
Well, when you're setting off 
explosions around the Princess,

00:07:57.360 --> 00:07:59.370
the national authorities can't let it slide.

00:08:00.340 --> 00:08:02.730
Mao-chan, help us!

00:08:02.730 --> 00:08:05.170
Seriously, that dimwitted Hero...

00:08:05.860 --> 00:08:08.800
Teacher, did you just say "Hero"?

00:08:08.800 --> 00:08:11.100
Yes, that's the Hero.

00:08:11.100 --> 00:08:11.670
Huh?

00:08:12.050 --> 00:08:15.410
Yes, it's utterly embarrassing, but it's true.

00:08:15.410 --> 00:08:17.180
But that's...

00:08:17.180 --> 00:08:19.430
They'll skewer me!

00:08:17.640 --> 00:08:19.430
a girl?

00:08:24.990 --> 00:08:25.690
Princess?

00:08:29.030 --> 00:08:32.570
I've been longing to meet you, my Hero!

00:08:32.950 --> 00:08:33.720
Huh?

00:08:35.150 --> 00:08:37.580
Long, long ago,

00:08:37.580 --> 00:08:41.460
when the Demon Lord appeared on 
Naral Island and the first Hero defeated him,

00:08:41.700 --> 00:08:44.970
that first Hero founded a nation.

00:08:44.970 --> 00:08:47.790
That nation was the Lapanesta Kingdom.

00:08:48.850 --> 00:08:52.340
For generations, we have 
aided and supported the Hero.

00:08:52.340 --> 00:08:55.390
That is the duty of the Lapanesta Kingdom,

00:08:55.390 --> 00:08:57.930
which traces its blood 
back to the first Hero.

00:08:59.220 --> 00:09:05.310
And now, a Hero has appeared 
here before us once more!

00:09:10.840 --> 00:09:14.990
This is the treasure entrusted to 
the royal family by the first Hero.

00:09:15.530 --> 00:09:17.230
"Dark Purple Fae Truth."

00:09:17.630 --> 00:09:21.500
It's said to have the power
 to see the truth of all things.

00:09:22.630 --> 00:09:24.390
There's no mistake!

00:09:24.390 --> 00:09:27.890
That's one of the "Seven Founding Heavens,"
the original seven cards

00:09:27.890 --> 00:09:30.660
that served as the foundation
for all modern Cartado...

00:09:30.660 --> 00:09:35.880
A Cartado that's mythically rare, 
which is rarer than legendary rare!

00:09:34.400 --> 00:09:35.880
Easy there, Mei-chan.

00:09:37.190 --> 00:09:38.640
Now, step forward.

00:09:39.450 --> 00:09:40.300
Yes, Princess!

00:10:03.570 --> 00:10:04.410
Oh?

00:10:05.020 --> 00:10:07.230
Yes, you're definitely the Hero.

00:10:07.370 --> 00:10:08.230
That easily?!

00:10:08.790 --> 00:10:10.400
Yulia Chardiet.

00:10:10.400 --> 00:10:12.610
In the name of the Lapanesta Kingdom,

00:10:12.610 --> 00:10:15.420
I hereby recognize you as the true Hero.

00:10:18.180 --> 00:10:19.430
Congratulations!

00:10:19.430 --> 00:10:23.220
Yusha! Yusha-chan!

00:10:20.060 --> 00:10:23.220
You definitely are the real Hero.

00:10:23.220 --> 00:10:25.680
I'm so happy!

00:10:26.390 --> 00:10:31.240
N-Now we can really hold our heads high 
when we call ourselves the Hero's party!

00:10:31.240 --> 00:10:34.510
We won't be given those 
faint smiles anymore!

00:10:34.940 --> 00:10:37.460
<i>Uh, this is something
 I shouldn't poke fun at.</i>

00:10:37.460 --> 00:10:39.820
<i>She's absolutely crying for real.</i>

00:10:40.040 --> 00:10:44.140
Uh, um... I'll do my best, Princess!

00:10:45.940 --> 00:10:48.740
Please call me Rona, Hero!

00:10:48.740 --> 00:10:50.270
Sure, Rona-chan!

00:10:51.300 --> 00:10:54.340
Indeed. Be sure to work hard.

00:10:54.700 --> 00:10:59.340
<i>Though this has nothing to do with me, now 
that I've given up on being the Demon Lord...</i>

00:10:59.590 --> 00:11:04.720
Now to leave no stone unturned as I search 
for the Demon Lord to defeat them!

00:11:04.890 --> 00:11:06.600
My, how encouraging!

00:11:07.080 --> 00:11:08.250
However,

00:11:08.250 --> 00:11:12.150
the Hero and Demon Lord 
are bound by deep ties.

00:11:12.150 --> 00:11:15.470
They might be surprisingly close by.

00:11:15.470 --> 00:11:16.200
<i>Huh?!</i>

00:11:18.340 --> 00:11:21.390
<i>No, it couldn't be...</i>

00:11:24.250 --> 00:11:25.430
<i>ENDRO!</i>

00:11:27.900 --> 00:11:29.880
Morning, Hero!

00:11:29.880 --> 00:11:32.000
Oh, Hero! Morning!

00:11:33.120 --> 00:11:37.610
Oh, you just barely made 
it in time today, Hero.

00:11:37.610 --> 00:11:38.380
Yeah!

00:11:38.760 --> 00:11:42.890
Thanks for finding my Lancelot
 the other day, Hero!

00:11:43.220 --> 00:11:46.810
Finding a cat is nothing for a Hero, huh?

00:11:48.020 --> 00:11:49.720
This is a first!

00:11:49.720 --> 00:11:52.190
Everyone's calling me "Hero"!

00:11:53.040 --> 00:11:55.340
The sound of their praise is pleasing.

00:11:55.340 --> 00:11:57.270
Y-Yeah!

00:11:57.270 --> 00:11:59.300
I was a bit concerned myself,

00:11:59.300 --> 00:12:02.990
but now we're officially recognized 
as the Hero's party, aren't we?

00:12:02.990 --> 00:12:04.320
Right?! Right?!

00:12:04.610 --> 00:12:07.090
Now that everyone's recognized us,

00:12:07.090 --> 00:12:09.750
let's work hard and be heroes again today!

00:12:09.750 --> 00:12:10.710
Yeah!

00:12:10.710 --> 00:12:12.440
No, that's completely unacceptable!

00:12:12.440 --> 00:12:14.120
R-Rona-chan?!

00:12:15.530 --> 00:12:16.970
You startled me.

00:12:16.970 --> 00:12:19.210
I didn't sense your presence at all.

00:12:21.040 --> 00:12:22.600
I have a general understanding

00:12:22.600 --> 00:12:25.250
after listening in on your discussions
 in the Hero's room last night,

00:12:25.250 --> 00:12:29.160
starting from when you discussed 
your plans for lunch today.

00:12:29.160 --> 00:12:31.170
Oh, okay. That speeds things up.

00:12:31.170 --> 00:12:32.780
Huh?! Hold on!

00:12:32.780 --> 00:12:35.980
She just said something 
we shouldn't overlook!

00:12:35.980 --> 00:12:39.500
You mustn't be satisfied with this, Hero!

00:12:39.500 --> 00:12:40.580
After all,

00:12:42.260 --> 00:12:48.030
all the students are completely lacking
 in their love for you, Hero!

00:12:48.280 --> 00:12:50.040
L-Love?!

00:12:50.360 --> 00:12:53.220
Your schoolmates have no 
idea how fortunate they are

00:12:53.220 --> 00:12:58.030
to live in the same age and 
be in the same place as you!

00:12:58.030 --> 00:13:01.940
We need to build up your foundation first.

00:13:01.940 --> 00:13:05.550
To make everyone understand 
how wonderful you are...

00:13:01.940 --> 00:13:04.610
Hey, Rona-chan?

00:13:05.860 --> 00:13:06.850
I know!

00:13:07.090 --> 00:13:08.680
Worry not!

00:13:08.680 --> 00:13:13.350
I shall endeavor to ensure that everyone 
knows how wonderful you are, Hero!

00:13:18.670 --> 00:13:20.450
What is this?

00:13:33.250 --> 00:13:35.000
What's the matter with you four?

00:13:35.000 --> 00:13:38.180
You look like a wyvern 
that's been hit by a fireball.

00:13:38.180 --> 00:13:40.130
Oh, Mao-chan, good morning.

00:13:40.520 --> 00:13:42.880
Mao-chan, what festival is this?

00:13:43.340 --> 00:13:44.220
This is...

00:13:44.220 --> 00:13:46.290
It's a festival I've created.

00:13:46.290 --> 00:13:48.260
I call it the "Hero Festival"!

00:13:49.060 --> 00:13:50.470
Hero Festival?

00:13:50.660 --> 00:13:51.600
Yes.

00:13:51.600 --> 00:13:55.090
Everyone loves festivals,
 so by throwing one for the Hero,

00:13:55.090 --> 00:13:57.560
I can make the whole school, and eventually,

00:13:57.560 --> 00:14:02.030
all of Naral Island see 
how wonderful you are!

00:14:02.030 --> 00:14:03.680
There you have it.

00:14:03.680 --> 00:14:08.660
We staff members and the Princess's knights
 have worked hard preparing it overnight.

00:14:10.430 --> 00:14:14.250
It's all for Yusha?
 That's some incredible initiative.

00:14:14.540 --> 00:14:19.180
Yes. I'm willing to do anything for the Hero!

00:14:19.180 --> 00:14:21.600
Really? Thanks!

00:14:22.380 --> 00:14:26.510
Just hearing you say that makes me so happy!

00:14:26.760 --> 00:14:29.650
Still, even if it was at the princess's request,

00:14:29.650 --> 00:14:31.970
you really pushed yourself hard, Mao-sensei.

00:14:32.550 --> 00:14:34.740
It was all for my cute students.

00:14:34.740 --> 00:14:35.740
And your true feelings?

00:14:36.180 --> 00:14:40.360
The adventurer school is actually 
run by the royal family.

00:14:40.360 --> 00:14:42.800
That ruins everything.

00:14:42.800 --> 00:14:45.070
So even adventurers who love their freedom

00:14:45.070 --> 00:14:49.090
are still just convenient servants 
of the politicians in the end.

00:14:50.720 --> 00:14:53.500
Now, let us go forth, Hero!

00:14:53.500 --> 00:14:56.510
Ellenoar-sama, Fai-sama, and Mather-sama, too!

00:14:57.500 --> 00:14:58.390
Come on!

00:15:00.580 --> 00:15:04.220
Her vitality is incredible for a princess.

00:15:04.220 --> 00:15:05.810
I'm kind of impressed.

00:15:05.810 --> 00:15:07.660
She certainly is impressive.

00:15:07.660 --> 00:15:12.180
It's incredible that she knows the 
names we nearly forgot ourselves!

00:15:12.180 --> 00:15:13.020
Huh?!

00:15:13.020 --> 00:15:15.040
That's what's impressive to you?!

00:15:15.040 --> 00:15:17.640
Ah, jeez! Let's get going, too!

00:15:17.640 --> 00:15:18.810
Yeah!

00:15:19.530 --> 00:15:23.440
Good grief. They're acting like 
children over some festival.

00:15:23.440 --> 00:15:26.060
It makes me laugh to think that's the Hero.

00:15:26.060 --> 00:15:27.100
Mao-sensei.

00:15:28.340 --> 00:15:33.240
I bought the cotton candy pomurun 
you were looking at with envy earlier.

00:15:33.240 --> 00:15:37.770
Go on, eat it up so fast that 
it gets your mouth all sticky!

00:15:37.980 --> 00:15:42.070
Oh... If you'd like, we could eat it together.

00:15:42.070 --> 00:15:48.970
Bringing our faces so close that your 
soft cheeks press against my own...

00:15:48.970 --> 00:15:50.900
Oh... Where did she go?

00:16:00.290 --> 00:16:00.980
Munch!

00:16:07.310 --> 00:16:08.110
Munch!

00:16:13.220 --> 00:16:13.870
Lick.

00:16:39.420 --> 00:16:40.880
How is it?

00:16:40.880 --> 00:16:44.650
Are you enjoying all the stalls
 I put together to promote you, Hero?

00:16:44.940 --> 00:16:49.430
Y-Yeah, you're really promoting me... I think.

00:16:49.430 --> 00:16:51.610
The Yu-chan cakes were delicious!

00:16:51.610 --> 00:16:54.080
The figure was wearing pink.

00:16:54.660 --> 00:16:55.720
That was the best!

00:16:56.330 --> 00:16:57.970
You're all mean!

00:16:57.970 --> 00:16:59.200
Sorry.

00:16:59.680 --> 00:17:02.220
But look around. Everyone's having fun.

00:17:08.760 --> 00:17:09.440
Yeah!

00:17:09.440 --> 00:17:10.960
I guess it's okay, then!

00:17:11.340 --> 00:17:13.500
You're as optimistic as ever.

00:17:13.500 --> 00:17:15.560
That's the nice thing about Yu-chan!

00:17:16.470 --> 00:17:18.610
That's how a Hero should be.

00:17:21.890 --> 00:17:23.130
Anyway...

00:17:23.130 --> 00:17:24.020
Huh?

00:17:24.020 --> 00:17:26.260
The main event of the festival is starting!

00:17:26.260 --> 00:17:27.850
Come on, everyone!

00:17:31.380 --> 00:17:33.860
Look over there!
 That's the Demon Lord's castle!

00:17:34.380 --> 00:17:36.500
Seira-chan, Fai-chan, Mei-chan,

00:17:36.500 --> 00:17:38.870
we finally made it to the Demon Lord's castle!

00:17:38.870 --> 00:17:43.200
I'll smash the Demon Lord to 
smithereens with my hammer!

00:17:43.200 --> 00:17:45.400
I'm so hungry.

00:17:45.400 --> 00:17:49.520
There should be some legendary rare 
Cartado at the Demon Lord's castle!

00:17:53.550 --> 00:17:56.720
They see me as a musclebound priest?!

00:17:57.200 --> 00:18:02.100
I worked hard to try to show 
everyone who you really are!

00:18:02.260 --> 00:18:03.570
You did?

00:18:04.390 --> 00:18:05.980
Thanks, Rona-chan!

00:18:07.580 --> 00:18:08.810
Hero...

00:18:09.180 --> 00:18:12.080
U-Um, I...

00:18:17.840 --> 00:18:19.410
Sip, sip.

00:18:20.210 --> 00:18:21.580
Delicious!

00:18:22.380 --> 00:18:24.260
I was just getting thirsty, too.

00:18:24.260 --> 00:18:25.900
Thanks, Rona-chan.

00:18:26.940 --> 00:18:32.310
I've always admired the Hero, 
ever since I was little.

00:18:32.310 --> 00:18:33.070
Huh?

00:18:36.280 --> 00:18:39.220
My heart raced with exciting thoughts 
of the Hero's adventures,

00:18:39.220 --> 00:18:42.010
and I always thought to myself,

00:18:42.810 --> 00:18:45.060
what if the real Hero were to appear?

00:18:48.150 --> 00:18:51.960
And I dreamed of one day 
becoming the Hero's bride.

00:18:52.520 --> 00:18:56.530
I can't believe that I actually 
get to meet the Hero like this!

00:18:57.110 --> 00:18:59.910
But we're both women, you know.

00:19:00.270 --> 00:19:02.870
That's a trifling matter in the face of love.

00:19:02.870 --> 00:19:04.930
The law is something I can deal with.

00:19:04.930 --> 00:19:06.040
Oh...

00:19:07.720 --> 00:19:13.800
Please, will you...
 let me be by your side, Hero?

00:19:20.820 --> 00:19:24.380
My face is all shiny and sticky.

00:19:24.380 --> 00:19:28.310
How can that woman keep up with a 
Demon Lord who's trying her best to run away?

00:19:29.130 --> 00:19:31.230
Oh, this is perfect.

00:19:36.510 --> 00:19:37.570
Wh-What?!

00:19:38.010 --> 00:19:39.280
Wait, this is a...

00:19:42.070 --> 00:19:44.450
They're using a real monster?

00:19:44.450 --> 00:19:46.500
Just how big is this princess?

00:19:46.980 --> 00:19:50.100
Well, at least red bulldozers 
are docile monsters,

00:19:50.100 --> 00:19:55.170
so long as you don't... 
pull... their... tails...

00:20:02.620 --> 00:20:04.500
Huh?! What's that? What happened?!

00:20:04.500 --> 00:20:08.270
That's the monster I prepared for the play!

00:20:08.480 --> 00:20:09.390
Huh?!

00:20:14.030 --> 00:20:15.300
Sorry, Rona-chan!

00:20:15.300 --> 00:20:17.780
I need to go for now. We can talk later!

00:20:18.730 --> 00:20:20.200
Please wait!

00:20:20.200 --> 00:20:23.910
My knights are already here, 
and so are the teachers.

00:20:24.300 --> 00:20:27.720
There's no need for you 
to trouble yourself, Hero!

00:20:27.720 --> 00:20:30.660
Yeah... but I'm still going.

00:20:31.100 --> 00:20:33.920
Because you're the Hero?

00:20:34.260 --> 00:20:37.550
That's not it... exactly?

00:20:38.070 --> 00:20:40.340
It's, uh...

00:20:42.840 --> 00:20:44.550
Because I'm me, I guess!

00:20:54.450 --> 00:20:56.120
Well, I'm heading out!

00:21:02.600 --> 00:21:04.820
Not because you're the Hero,

00:21:06.260 --> 00:21:08.080
but because it's who you are?

00:21:09.350 --> 00:21:10.080
Huh?

00:21:10.860 --> 00:21:11.720
Huh?

00:21:12.040 --> 00:21:12.830
What?

00:21:14.980 --> 00:21:15.800
What...

00:21:28.940 --> 00:21:33.600
Well, in short, we have a transfer student.

00:21:33.860 --> 00:21:34.940
Rona-chan!

00:21:35.180 --> 00:21:38.440
Yes! I'm the Hero's Rona!

00:21:41.430 --> 00:21:44.430
I hope we'll all get along.

00:21:45.670 --> 00:21:48.450
You too, Mao-sama.
 I hope we get along well, too.

00:21:49.690 --> 00:21:53.700
This is but another fate 
laid forth by the world.

00:21:54.890 --> 00:21:56.960
<i>This girl really does...</i>

00:22:00.460 --> 00:22:04.970
Roll 5

00:23:35.890 --> 00:23:39.400
"One Room, 100 Square Feet, 
Demon Lord Included!"

00:23:39.940 --> 00:23:39.980
One Room, 100 Square Feet, 
Demon Lord Included!
